[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0032","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0032.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0075","title":"Technote 2000/2001 main.cgi 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Technote 2000/2001 的 main.cgi 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 filename 参数传入 `../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、密码文件等），影响运行 Technote 2000/2001 的 Web 服务器。攻击者只需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可利用，攻击门槛低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0075"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36Z","remediation":"Technote 产品已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即删除或禁用 `main.cgi` 脚本，或从 Web 服务器配置中移除 `/technote/` 路径的 CGI 执行权限。如必须使用该功能，在 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）层面添加重写规则，对 `filename` 参数过滤 `../` 等目录遍历序列，并限制只能访问特定目录下的文件。同时建议迁移至其他仍在维护的 Web 公告板产品。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/153212","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2156","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20523","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0075.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0075.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0075","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0075.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0075.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2001/CVE-2001-0075.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0075.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0075.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0075.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0075.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0032.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0031","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0031.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0074","title":"Technote print.cgi 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Technote 2000/2001 的 print.cgi 脚本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向 board 参数传递 `../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞可导致敏感信息泄露，如配置文件、密码文件等。攻击条件简单，仅需目标系统运行 Technote 且 print.cgi 可访问，利用难度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0074"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:36Z","remediation":"立即删除或禁用 Technote 软件包中的 print.cgi 脚本，或限制其仅允许授权用户访问。如仍需使用，在 print.cgi 中对 board 参数做严格的路径合法性校验，拒绝包含 \"../\" 或空字节 \"%00\" 的输入，并将可访问目录限定在预设的 boards 目录内。由于 Technote 产品已停止维护，建议迁移至其他仍在维护的论坛/留言板系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/153007","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2155","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20522","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c31c0a9b9af147bd58078ebf7769418f19d3f2e1/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0074","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/230692da2420d9855e520154fdb81ed9f2cb832a/2001/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b6c80ad7b47e52f64ae2ee2b20e56d7eaaaa57fe/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1d7706ed603ab73481cbc20e5bea092e02e7c9be/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0074.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0074.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0074.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0031.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0031.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0031.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0029","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0029.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0059","title":"Sun Solaris patchadd 竞争条件漏洞","description":"Solaris patchadd 实用程序存在竞争条件漏洞，本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，在 patchadd 以特权运行处理补丁文件的时间窗口内，诱导其覆盖任意系统文件。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5.1、2.6、7.0 和 8.0 版本，攻击向量为本地（AV:L），攻击复杂度高（AC:H），需本地账户权限，成功利用可导致机密性、完整性、可用性完全丧失（CVSS 6.2）。攻击者需预先在可写目录植入指向敏感文件的符号链接，随后触发 patchadd 操作，利用 TOCTOU 窗口实现任意文件覆盖，进而提权或破坏系统完整性。Sun Microsystems 已发布补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0059"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 操作系统到已发布的安全补丁版本，如 Solaris 8 补丁 111522-12 或更高版本。这些补丁修复了 patchadd 程序的 race 条件漏洞，通过使用更安全的临时文件创建方式（如使用 mktemp 或确保原子操作）来防止 symlink 攻击。同时，可以设置 TMPDIR 环境变量到安全的专用目录，并确保 /tmp 目录的权限设置为 700，以限制其他用户创建恶意 symlink 的能力。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=97720205217707&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2127","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5789","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20514","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0059","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/e9b51a58e4ac0e6b00dc38147f459707e98ae056/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/4b74475b4552ac50c2b0e9c897e19d52aaa35c66/2001/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0059.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0059.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0059.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0029.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0027","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0053","title":"OpenBSD ftpd 单字节缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"基于 BSD 的 ftpd 中的 replydirname 函数存在单字节缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标 FTP 服务器发送特制的目录路径请求触发该漏洞，导致缓冲区越界写入，最终可获取目标系统的 root 权限。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD ftpd 2.6/2.7 及 BSD ftpd 0.3.2 等版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已有公开的利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0053"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:34Z","remediation":"升级 OpenBSD 至 2.8 及以上版本（该漏洞已在 OpenBSD 2.8 中修复），或禁用 ftpd 服务（`/etc/inetd.conf` 中注释掉 ftp 行并重启 inetd）。如必须使用 ftpd，建议替换为 vsftpd 或 ProFTPD 等维护中的替代方案，并在防火墙限制对 21 端口的访问来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0275.html","http://www.openbsd.org/advisories/ftpd_replydirname.txt","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2124","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5776","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20512","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0053.json","https://github.com/nmap/nmap/blob/d5645bf76da55c056082a99593de1b5ef645bfa8/nselib/vulns.lua","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0053","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0053.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0053.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/08fba6d93d7b2eb4e2149df128118cb379076728/2001/CVE-2001-0053.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/a939a0e06ea28df0537defbf2bf781fcb02ed201/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0053.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0053.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0053.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/7c13974e8672408967145db42c357210cb59d951/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0053.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0027.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0015","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0015.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0029","title":"Oops! WWW Proxy Server 堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"tags.<value>Oops! WWW 代理服务器 1.4.6 版本（可能影响其他版本）存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标代理服务器发送特制请求，触发反向 DNS 查询获取超长主机名或域名，导致堆缓冲区溢出，从而可执行任意系统命令并完全控制目标服务器。该漏洞影响部署了 Oops! 代理服务器的各类网络环境，攻击者可利用该漏洞在无需任何凭据的情况下获取服务器的完全控制权限，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级为严重。ExploitDB 已公开相关利用代码，攻击者可直接复现利用。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0029"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:31Z","remediation":"立即升级 oops WWW 代理服务器至 1.4.7 或更高版本以修复堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法获取更新版本，应在启动代理时添加\"-r\"参数禁用反向 DNS 查询功能，从而阻断攻击者利用长主机名触发溢出的路径。同时通过防火墙规则限制代理服务器的访问来源，仅允许受信任的内部网络连接，并将服务监听端口改为非标准端口以降低被扫描到的风险。若系统允许，建议将 oops 替换为仍在积极维护的 Squid 或 Nginx 代理方案，彻底消除该漏洞风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0158.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2099","http://zipper.paco.net/~igor/oops/ChangeLog","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6122","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/228","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0029.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0029.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0029","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0029.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0029.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1a293285bf198645eacfa1fb6bdd6757780626e5/2001/CVE-2001-0029.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0029.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0029.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0029.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0029.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0015.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0015.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0015.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0014","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0014.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0028","title":"Oops Proxy Server 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0028是一个安全漏洞，影响相关产品的安全性。攻击者可能利用此漏洞执行任意代码或获取未授权访问。建议用户及时更新到最新版本以修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0028"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:31Z","remediation":"由于 Oops Proxy Server 1.5.2 及更早版本存在严重的缓冲区溢出漏洞且已停止维护，建议立即停止使用该软件，迁移至 Squid 或 Nginx 等现代安全代理服务器。若必须临时使用，请在防火墙层面限制访问该服务的 IP 范围，或通过入侵检测系统（IDS）拦截包含大量引号字符的异常 HTTP 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0127.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/freebsd/2000-12/0418.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2099","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5725","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20495","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a7bcc119a9ab3b42563555b8edc8c417e3560925/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0028.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0028.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0028","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0028.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0028.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c2d7976a30d9a4bb0d098cbb553bce11e610b2f4/2001/CVE-2001-0028.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0028.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/c55f50b14ae2241dec1fd7ddec6b7ce3c90c1fdb/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0028.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0028.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0028.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0014.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0013","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0026","title":"Roaring Penguin rp-pppoe 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Roaring Penguin rp-pppoe 2.4及更早版本的PPPoE客户端在Clamp MSS选项处理上存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，通过向目标系统发送带有零长度TCP选项的特制TCP数据包即可触发该漏洞，导致客户端服务异常终止或崩溃。该漏洞影响使用rp-pppoe作为PPPoE拨号客户端的Linux系统，攻击复杂度低，仅需网络可达即可利用。攻击成功后将造成部分服务不可用，但不影响系统机密性和完整性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0026"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30Z","remediation":"升级 rp-pppoe 到 ≥2.5 版本以获取 Clamp MSS 选项修复，或编译最新代码并应用针对 CVE-2001-0026 的安全补丁，同时确保禁用实验性 TCP 选项以缓解该拒绝服务漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0134.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000357","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/MDKSA-2000-084.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-130.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2098","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5727","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20494","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0026.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0026","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0026.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0026.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2001/CVE-2001-0026.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0026.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0026.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0026.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0026.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8ad35b62b45404de8f2963cc958f5644815c9afa/content/CVE-2001-0026.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0012","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0012.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0025","title":"Leif M. Wright ad.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Leif M. Wright 开发的 ad.cgi 1.0 CGI 程序存在命令注入漏洞，由于未对用户提供的 file 参数进行充分过滤和验证，远程攻击者可在该参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符、反引号等），从而在目标服务器上执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞利用门槛极低，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络远程发起利用，完全控制受影响系统。CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级严重。建议升级至安全版本或移除该 CGI 程序。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0025"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30Z","remediation":"Leif M. Wright 的 ad.cgi 1.0 为已被弃用的免费广告轮换 CGI 脚本，官方从未发布修复版本，因此无法通过版本升级消除此漏洞。建议立即从 Web 服务器上彻底移除 ad.cgi 脚本及其关联文件，改用其他经过安全审计且仍在维护的广告管理系统替代。如短期内无法下线，应在 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache .htaccess 或 Nginx 配置）中拒绝对外提供 ad.cgi 的访问，同时对 file 参数实施严格的输入验证，仅允许包含字母数字和下划线字符，并过滤所有 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符、反引号、$() 等），同时限制 CGI 脚本的运行权限，确保其以最小权限账户执行，禁止访问敏感系统文件和目录。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0143.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2103","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5741","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20504","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0025.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0025.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0025","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0025.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0025.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0025.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2001/CVE-2001-0025.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0025.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0025.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0025.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0012.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0012.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0012.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0011","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0024","title":"Leif M. Wright simplestmail.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"simplestmail.cgi 是 Leif M. Wright 开发的一款用于处理网页表单邮件响应的 CGI 脚本程序。该脚本在处理用户提交的 MyEmail 参数时，对 open() 函数的调用存在不安全结构，未能对用户输入中的 shell 元字符进行有效过滤。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP POST 请求，在 MyEmail 参数中注入 shell 元字符，从而在 Web 服务器权限下执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响所有部署了 simplestmail.cgi 1.0 版本的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需认证即可获得服务器的命令执行权限，进而可能导致服务器被完全控制。CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0024"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30Z","remediation":"立即从服务器上删除 simplestmail.cgi 文件及其在 cgi-bin 目录下的所有副本，该脚本作者 Leif M. Wright 早已停止维护且从未发布补丁版本。将其替换为受支持的现代替代方案，如使用 PHP 内置 mail() 函数或成熟的 Web 表单邮件库，替代方案必须对用户输入进行严格的参数化过滤，禁止将未经过滤的输入直接传入 shell 命令。若短期内无法完成替换，应在 Web 服务器层面对 cgi-bin 目录实施访问控制（如 Apache 的 <Directory> 指令或 Nginx 的 location 匹配规则）阻断外部对该脚本的访问，同时在防火墙规则中禁止对外访问该 CGI 端口作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0136.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2102","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5739","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20503","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d38333dcfe51fc2081856da5d31bbece1a0cced/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/954745087cab3897c1945b517c4fc4f1575af37b/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0024","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/336c506d8c2ab5b6ec8e55edc2021c49b3be8e2c/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09467eccc569d3c2d05f9926f06cbaa3adc3361a/2001/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0024.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0024.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0024.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0011.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0011.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0010","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0010.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0023","title":"Leif M. Wright everythingform.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"everythingform.cgi 是 Leif M. Wright 开发的 CGI 程序（版本 2.0），该程序在处理用户提交的 config 参数时未对 shell 元字符进行充分过滤，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在 config 参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符、反引号等）来执行任意操作系统命令。运行 everythingform.cgi 2.0 版本的所有 Web 服务器均受影响，攻击者无需任何身份认证，只需能够远程访问目标 Web 服务器上的该 CGI 脚本，并通过 HTTP 请求向 config 参数提交包含恶意 shell 元字符的输入即可触发漏洞。攻击者通过构造包含 shell 元字符的 HTTP 请求将 payload 嵌入 config 参数，Web 服务器执行该 CGI 脚本时会解析并执行注入的命令，从而获得服务器的命令执行权限，可进一步用于信息窃取、权限提升或作为后续攻击的跳板。该漏洞的 CVSS 评分为满分 10.0，危害程度极为严重，远程利用难度极低且影响范围广泛。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0023"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30Z","remediation":"1. 立即从 Web 服务器中移除 everythingform.cgi 文件，或将其权限修改为不可执行（如 chmod 644 并置于 cgi-bin 之外）；2. 如仍需使用，升级到 Leif M. Wright 发布的最新修正版本并确认漏洞已修复；3. 在 Web 服务器配置（如 Apache httpd.conf）中禁用对 .cgi 脚本的自动执行，或使用 suEXEC/cgiwrap 等机制限制脚本权限；4. 临时缓解措施：在防火墙或 Web 服务器层面对 /everythingform.cgi 路径实施访问控制（IP 白名单或路径阻断），并开启 CGI 执行日志监控异常请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0137.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2101","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5736","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20497","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0023.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0023.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0023","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0023.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0023.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0023.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/578e3191a13a48b3de7e4ff1967f7100da5c1b72/2001/CVE-2001-0023.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/73af4cfb14d58e2696d2d55ddfcc14e42bb1eef7/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0023.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0023.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0023.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0010.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0010.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0010.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0009","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0009.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0022","title":"Leif M. Wright simplestguest.cgi 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Leif M. Wright 开发的 simplestguest.cgi 2.0 版本留言板程序存在远程命令执行漏洞。该 CGI 程序在处理 guestbook 参数时未对用户输入进行过滤，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过在参数中注入 shell 元字符（如分号、管道符、反引号等）拼接恶意系统命令，进而在服务器端执行任意指令。由于该程序通常部署于 Web 服务器（如 Apache）的 CGI 目录下，攻击者可直接通过 HTTP 请求远程利用，无需认证且攻击复杂度低。该漏洞影响运行 simplestguest.cgi 2.0 的 Web 服务器，成功利用可导致攻击者完全控制目标服务器，包括读取敏感文件、修改网页内容、植入后门等，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0022"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:30Z","remediation":"升级到 simplerguest.cgi 或已验证修复的 CGI 处理脚本；修改 guestbook 参数验证逻辑，使用 prepared statements 或 parameterized queries 过滤 shell 元字符；限制 CGI 执行用户权限为非 root；部署 WAF 规则过滤包含管道符 \"|\"、\";、\"等危险字符的 HTTP 请求；定期应用安全补丁并审计文件权限设置。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-12/0168.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2106","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5743","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20506","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9aad85737366330ff6d3c29419443c9111c35207/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/089f2bd75278699e025a97f7a87bc7cf94b50970/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0022","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/578e3191a13a48b3de7e4ff1967f7100da5c1b72/2001/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ccbb22644b8f8cd8300036a10ac1ec6d68c2d1a3/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0022.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0022.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0022.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0009.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0009.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0009.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0007","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0007.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0010","title":"ISC BIND 8.2.x TSIG 远程堆缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 8 的 TSIG（事务签名）处理代码中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过向目标 DNS 服务器发送特制的 TSIG 签名数据包触发该溢出，进而执行任意代码获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响运行 BIND 8.2.x 版本的 DNS 服务器，攻击条件宽松，仅需目标服务器启用 TSIG 功能且暴露于网络即可发起攻击。由于 BIND 是互联网上广泛使用的 DNS 服务器软件，此漏洞潜在影响范围极广，CVSS 评分高达 10.0，危害等级为严重。攻击者成功利用后可完全控制 DNS 服务器，对互联网域名解析服务造成重大威胁。ISC 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0010"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:29Z","remediation":"建议立即将 BIND 8.2.x 升级至 BIND 9.16.x 或更高受支持的稳定版本（BIND 8.x 已停止维护，无法获得官方安全补丁）。如需临时缓解，可在 named.conf 配置文件中注释或删除所有 \"keys\" 及 \"allow-transfer\" 相关的 TSIG 密钥配置项，并重新加载配置（rndc reconfig），以禁用 TSIG 功能阻止远程利用；同时通过防火墙限制 UDP/TCP 53 端口仅对授权的辅助 DNS 服务器开放，禁止外部主机的区域传输请求，直至完成版本升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-02.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-026","http://www.nai.com/research/covert/advisories/047.asp","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-007.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2302","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/280","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2001/CVE-2001-0010.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/663b7221ac0c437440bcbb2f29bd619793e09cad/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0010.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2001/CVE-2001-0010.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0010","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0010.json","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/853fff3f588474906eaaeec56c4eeef32edfc06c/CVEs/2001/CVE-2001-0010.md","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0010.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0010.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2001/CVE-2001-0010.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3979a7633898f20f850131e08d621fa27d545855/2001/CVE-2001-0010.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0007.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0006","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0006.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0009","title":"Lotus Domino 服务器目录遍历漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Lotus Domino Server 5.0.5 的 Web 服务器存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\" 序列的特制 URL 路径突破目录访问限制，从而读取服务器文件系统上的任意敏感文件。该漏洞影响 Lotus Domino Server 5.0.x 版本，攻击者无需身份验证即可通过网络向目标服务器发送恶意请求并获取敏感数据。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0009"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:28Z","remediation":"升级 Lotus Domino Server 至 5.0.7 或更高版本以修复该目录遍历漏洞。如暂时无法升级，请在防火墙或路由器层面限制外部对 Domino HTTP 服务（80 端口）的访问，或暂时禁用 Web 服务器功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1703","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/154537","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/155124","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2173","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5899","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20530","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0009.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0009.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0009","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0009.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0009.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2001/CVE-2001-0009.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0009.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0009.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0009.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/b41e970743d15aec60299cbc12139ba5a0ac3bb6/content/CVE-2001-0009.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0006.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0005","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0005.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0008","title":"Borland/Inprise Interbase 数据库服务器后门账号漏洞","description":"Borland/Inprise InterBase 4.0、5.0 及 6.0 版本的数据库服务器内置了一个隐藏的后门账户（Backdoor Account），该账户带有已知的默认凭据。由于这些版本在安装时硬编码了该特权账户且无法通过常规手段清除，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用该后门账户直接登录数据库服务器，并通过调用存储过程（stored procedures）对服务器上的任意文件进行覆盖或写入操作，进而导致任意文件覆盖、数据篡改乃至系统完全受控。由于该漏洞无需任何认证即可远程触发，CVSS 评分为 10.0，危害等级为严重。受影响范围覆盖 Borland/Inprise InterBase 4.0 至 6.0 全系列版本，未进行相应版本升级或后门账户清理的部署环境均存在被入侵风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0008"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:28Z","remediation":"由于该漏洞自 Interbase 6.0 之前版本就存在已知的后门账户（用户名 \"politically\"、密码 \"correct\"），建议立即升级到受支持的版本或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。具体操作：1) 联系 Borland/Embarcadero 获取该漏洞的官方补丁并部署，或升级至不再包含默认后门的版本；2) 若无法立即升级，需通过配置文件或数据库用户管理禁用或删除名为 \"politically\" 的后门账户，并删除对应的存储过程权限；3) 限制弱口令账户 Min 与 Politically 的登录，在防火墙/访问控制层仅允许可信 IP 访问 Interbase 服务端端口（默认 3050），禁止远程执行存储过程；4) 针对远程攻击者可利用存储过程覆盖任意文件的特性，撤销 guest/后门账户对文件系统相关存储过程的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2001-01.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2192","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5911","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20537","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ad23a84307831b745d27b34af84abc59130b2cd5/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0008.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0008.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0008","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0008.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0008.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/3563307faac29cd78316d24dffd5b35b4d38cc65/2001/CVE-2001-0008.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e3f82cb4abb129ac4e65ce1b058ead82032d2595/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0008.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0008.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0008.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0008.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0005.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0004","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0007","title":"NetScreen Firewall WebUI 缓冲区溢出拒绝服务漏洞","description":"NetScreen Firewall 的 Web 管理界面存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 Web 管理界面发送超长的 URL 请求来触发该溢出，导致防火墙服务拒绝服务、无法正常处理网络流量。该漏洞影响 ScreenOS 1.73 及 2.x 版本，攻击者无需任何凭据即可在目标设备上造成服务中断，影响网络边界安全防护能力。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0007"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"2001-02-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:53:28Z","remediation":"建议升级 NetScreen ScreenOS 至 2.1.1 或更高版本以修复 WebUI 缓冲区溢出漏洞。如暂时无法升级，应通过访问控制列表限制 Web 管理界面仅允许可信 IP 地址访问，或改用命令行接口（CLI）进行设备管理，从而阻断远程攻击者对 WebUI 的长 URL 请求攻击路径。升级完成后需重启防火墙服务使补丁生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/1707","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/155149","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2176","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5908","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20532","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4cd39de946c4dae2d75d1f265b016c2f29e5b92a/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4c1d71175e32f1e731b0a7d2c22a87887c3669cd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0007","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a3231978c760368f8f6b5637cdf1c49798e2fdc5/2001/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/353abf5c18895cee7a7860cfcca22d54b4bee560/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0007.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-00xx/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0007.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0007.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0004.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0004.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0004.toml"}]